    "Name": "Phoenix Hawk LAM PHX-PHK",
    "Details": "In 2778, having lost three quarters of his combined forces, General Aleksandr Kerenksy dug deep into past experiments. Needing to replace Aerotech and Mech units, he revived the Land Air project with self-contained weapon systems that could be carried into combat by these otherwise woefully under-armed units. Abandoned during Operation Exodus in 2784 and subsequently raided by Pirates in 3082, the Phoenix Hawk LAM has become a real threat during border raids.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Land Air Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>",
    "Icon": "PhoenixhawkLAM"
  },
